 "remarks": "Move in ready beautiful townhouse in the hidden Horizon Townhouse & Condominiums complex, tucked into the quiet Broad River neighborhood. This bright unit features a large living room with fireplace, dining area, updated kitchen with new granite countertops, stainless steel appliances and half bathroom on the main floor. Sliding doors to private terrace off dining room. Upstairs you will find two primary bedrooms with generous closets with a Jack and Jill bathroom. Additional features include central air and two convenient dedicated parking spaces. Plenty of guest parking is available. Conveniently located near highways, train station, shops, schools, and Sono. Available 8/1.",
